{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2060,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the set up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3230,
    "dDurationMs": 4959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a balance and two identical beakers,\nwhich I fill with exactly the same amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8189,
    "dDurationMs": 4221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of water, except in one of the beakers there\nis a submerged ping pong ball tethered to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12410,
    "dDurationMs": 1139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the base of the beaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13549,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the other there is an identically sized\nball but made of acrylic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18150,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is denser than water and it is supported\nby a thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21910,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want you to make a prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23929,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I were to release this balance and allow\nit to rotate freely, which way do you think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28599,
    "dDurationMs": 6571,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would tip, toward the acrylic ball, toward\nthe ping pong ball or would it remain perfectly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35170,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "balanced?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36170,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can make your selection by clicking on\none of the on screen annotations or clicking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39540,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a link in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40740,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e If they are both displacing the same amount,\nlike, I think it won’t rotate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, yes, it will not rotate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Stay balanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51000,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The ping pong ball does have mass, albeit\nnot very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53960,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would predict that this end will sink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57140,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I almost feel like this end would lift,\nbecause it is lighter than ... but it wouldn’t"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61750,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be pulling, because it is tethered to the\nlever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64000,
    "dDurationMs": 1049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65049,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I am thinking it would go this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67869,
    "dDurationMs": 4011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am thinking because of the tension that\nis pulling this up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71880,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So I guess if your summing the forces,\nthis one is more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74670,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then this is going to rise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75670,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76670,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77670,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just switched my mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79170,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am going to go with this one is going to\nrise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81240,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But, I mean, it seems like this shouldn’t\nbe contributing any force to this side, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85310,
    "dDurationMs": 2109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is suspended and the forces are balanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87419,
    "dDurationMs": 3861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That means you would have more of a normal\nforce on this side and it would tip that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91280,
    "dDurationMs": 1579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It will tip down on the ping pong ball\nside?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92859,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, definitely the ping pong ball side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94189,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95189,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is so weird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96189,
    "dDurationMs": 10990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So now you think it is going to up on this\nside and down on this side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107179,
    "dDurationMs": 5510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Are you ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112689,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three, two, one."
    } ]
  } ]
}
